<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5348] After Spring Boot upgrade version, the Chinese returned by the query is garbled</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5348</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is a problem caused by the upgrade of spring boot, which no longer adds UTF-8 encoding by default.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13510421">KYLIN-5348</key>
            <summary>After Spring Boot upgrade version, the Chinese returned by the query is garbled</summary>
