                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17644294" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2022 11:49:40 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Set server.servlet.encoding.force=true as the default parameter to solve the problem.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17655394" author="jira-bot" created="Fri, 6 Jan 2023 11:10:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Commit eade3c6e1e5e30ef91ab73eb1b80590a97f98fdd in kylin&apos;s branch refs/heads/kylin5 from lixiang&lt;br/&gt;
[ &lt;a href=&quot;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=eade3c6e1e&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=eade3c6e1e&lt;/a&gt; ]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5348&quot; title=&quot;After Spring Boot upgrade version, the Chinese returned by the query is garbled&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-5348&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-5348&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; add server.servlet.encoding.force=true to enable setting UTF-8&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17656451" author="jira-bot" created="Tue, 10 Jan 2023 06:43:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Commit eade3c6e1e5e30ef91ab73eb1b80590a97f98fdd in kylin&apos;s branch refs/heads/kylin5.0.0-alpha from lixiang&lt;br/&gt;
[ &lt;a href=&quot;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=eade3c6e1e&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=eade3c6e1e&lt;/a&gt; ]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5348&quot; title=&quot;After Spring Boot upgrade version, the Chinese returned by the query is garbled&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-5348&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-5348&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; add server.servlet.encoding.force=true to enable setting UTF-8&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
